      "writtenOn": "2019-04-03T21:58:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, carrierPackageNames always have carrier privilege on the current phone object. If pkgName that\u0027s passed in doesn\u0027t have it, then we return false and bail because the CarrierConfig is old and doesn\u0027t apply to the currently loaded subscription... this could happen if someone managed to switch sims really quickly, for instance... by the time CC loaded the subscription could change.",
